l their expectations.\n\n#### Our Mission [...] At Kothari Construction Company, we are proud to have Mr. Kothari at the helm, guiding us towards a brighter and more prosperous future. Our project is Maha RERA registered and accredited too. His leadership and vision inspires us to continue striving for excellence and delivering the best services to our customers.\n\nimage\n\n## +Office\n\n## +Projects\n\n## +Customers\n\n## +Awards\n\nimage\n\n### Why Choose Us\n\nWith in-depth knowledge, we deliver exceptional and genuine services that serve the society better. Our young engineers are always excited to implement the latest technologies in their projects. We encourage people to think beyond the reach, helping them dream big and we acknowledge them all at Kothari Construction Company. [...] #### Our Mission\n\nOur motto is to deliver quality homes to all. We strive to create healthy lifestyles by enhancing your living space to grow and live in a society that is surrounded with a positive aura. The language of happiness at KCC is House plus Love is equal to Home.\n\n### From Director’s Desk\n\nSince 2003, Mr. Pankaj Kothari has been the Managing Director at Kothari Construction Company. He is an alumnus of IIM (Ahmedabad). Currently he is a chairman of ACCE(I), Akola Chapter and a former Vice President CREDAI, Maharashtra. Mr. Kothariji is the motivation behind more than 5000 happy customers and satisfied clients.","score":0.5521781,"raw_content":null,"id":"50ced8-03"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/kothari-lotus-green-facilities-geeta-nagar-akola-npxid-r385744","title":"Kothari Lotus Green - Geeta Nagar, Akola Facilities - 99acres.com","content":"Amenities/Specification Park Car Parking Internal Street Lights Community Hall Fire Fighting Systems Lifts 24/7 Power Backup Sewage Treatment Plant 24/7 Water","score":0.5521781,"raw_content":null,"id":"a61a02-04"},{"url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/kothari-construction-company","title":"Kothari Construction Company - 